{"synopsis":"Anak yang ditemukan di rumah kosong, Mori, terbangun di panti setelah diselamatkan oleh tim penyelamat. Suatu hari, saat ia mulai beradaptasi dengan kehidupan yang asing, ia merasakan cinta tanpa syarat dari sang dermawan… Temannya yang selama ini dekat dengannya pergi bersama ibunya, dan Mori pun mengetahui bahwa ada sosok yang disebut “ibu”. Ia mulai berpikir, “Apakah orang ini… ibu saya?”\nCerita tentang perjalanan panjang dan penuh rintangan Mori untuk menemui ibunya.","alternative_title":"엄마를 만나러 가는 길, On the Way to Meet Mom","author":"gomyang","artist":"gomyang","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"16e2f8b3-6b45-4b82-a93d-17173a4307e0","number":"33.5","chapter":"33.5","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.5/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.5/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.5/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.5/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.5/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.5/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.5/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.5/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.5/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.5/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"9491d6d3-d930-4e49-aa6d-5defb0a327e8","number":"33.4","chapter":"33.4","title":"","date":"2026-07-21","released":"2026-07-21","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_2b826da7-3787-4370-95ad-7da2dd7d44b2/chapter_ch_33.4/1.w